        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "We execute targeted 4-week exhibition marketing sprints: teaser countdown reels on social media, digital press releases to art publications, local event geo-fencing ads, and automated WhatsApp VIP invitations to registered art patrons."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How do 360° virtual galleries help international and out-of-town art sales?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "A 360° interactive virtual gallery allows collectors in London, New York, Dubai, or Mumbai to explore your physical exhibition walls, zoom in on brushstrokes, view artwork pricing, and purchase directly with secure escrow."
