        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How does E-Commerce SEO help art galleries and artists?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Fine art SEO ranks your collection pages for terms like 'abstract canvas paintings for living room', 'bronze sculptures for sale', or 'famous Indian contemporary artists', driving free, ongoing collector traffic to your catalog."
